r. I need to save BlackJoker for a more critical moment.\n\nReason: \nI should PASS here. My teammate has only 2 cards and is very close to winning. Wasting my BlackJoker (the second-most powerful card) just to beat a King is strategically poor. I need to preserve this card for crucial moments - either to help my teammate make their final play or to block the Landlord\'s endgame. Letting the Landlord lead this round is acceptable since I retain my powerful cards for when they matter most.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
